## Key Concepts

- **IncrementalPCA**: Ideal for streaming data with mini-batch updates, allowing real-time adaptation
- **Missing Data Imputation**: Simple mean imputation maintains speed while handling occasional gaps
- **Component Selection**: Explained variance threshold (>90%) provides automated dimensionality decision
- **Loadings Interpretation**: High-loading features drive deterministic alert generation
- **Latency Optimization**: Efficient batch processing ensures sub-5ms transaction processing

## Code Example

